    "privacy.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effective date: September 24, 2026\n\nPetal Checklist stores cards, todos, completion states, reminders, and import history locally on your Mac. The app and widget share a sandboxed local store. Device preferences, widget layout, shortcuts, and onboarding completion stay local and are excluded from Petal JSON backups and iCloud replication.\n\nWhen iCloud sync is enabled, card and reminder data are replicated through Apple's CloudKit private database for your Apple Account. Apple provides this service under its own terms. Petal has no developer-operated content server, Petal account, advertising, or analytics SDK, and the developer does not collect your card contents or usage analytics. Your Mac login and Apple's services protect access; Petal does not provide an additional password lock or custom encryption.\n\nNotifications are optional. Petal asks for permission when you save your first enabled reminder, and schedules notifications on each authorized device. Notification text may reveal todo content on your lock screen according to macOS settings. Sound is off by default. You can change notification permission in System Settings.\n\nYou can import Windows notes, export JSON backups or Markdown, and replace your data from a JSON backup. Files are written to locations you choose. You control any copies you share or store elsewhere. A full restore replaces the dataset on all synced devices; it is not a local-only merge. Backups include reminder sound preference but exclude device layout and onboarding state.\n\nTrash and recoverable conflict copies are retained for 30 days and cleaned up when the app next processes the store. Content-free deletion metadata can remain in private iCloud to prevent older offline edits from returning. Very old devices with genuinely newer edits may restore records after the 30-day deletion-precedence window. Pending cloud changes require sync to be enabled and iCloud to be available; disabling sync keeps the local copy and does not erase the cloud copy.\n\nDelete All Data requires the localized product name and replaces data with one empty Inbox. Deletion propagates to all synced devices when they connect. Local cleanup and widget refresh can be retried if they fail. Cloud deletion is asynchronous: check sync status, and reconnect other devices. External backups, exports, Apple-managed backups, and copies you shared are not deleted by Petal. Recovery is possible only from copies you retained.\n\nFeedback opens your email app with only app version, build, macOS version, and architecture. No card content, identifiers, paths, logs, or diagnostics are automatically attached. You choose whether to send and what to include. Your email provider and a configured support mailbox receive any email you send. The development build has no support mailbox configured; it will be configured before release.\n\nThis static help site uses no cookies, analytics, scripts, remote fonts, or external resources. GitHub Pages hosting may process standard connection information under GitHub's own privacy terms; Petal adds no tracking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生效日期：2026 年 9 月 24 日\n\n花瓣清单将卡片、待办、完成状态、提醒和导入记录保存在您的 Mac 本机。App 与小组件共用沙盒内的本地存储。设备偏好、小组件布局、快捷键和引导完成状态仅保存在本机，不包含在 Petal JSON 备份或 iCloud 复制中。\n\n启用 iCloud 同步后，卡片与提醒数据通过 Apple CloudKit 复制到您 Apple 账户的私人数据库。Apple 按其自身条款提供此服务。花瓣清单没有开发者运营的内容服务器、Petal 账户、广告或行为分析 SDK；开发者不收集您的卡片内容或使用分析数据。访问保护依赖 Mac 登录和 Apple 服务；花瓣清单不提供额外密码锁或自定义加密。\n\n通知为可选功能。首次保存已启用的提醒时，花瓣清单会申请通知权限，并在每台已授权设备上安排通知。根据 macOS 设置，通知可能在锁屏上显示待办内容。声音默认关闭。您可以在系统设置中更改通知权限。\n\n您可以导入 Windows 便签、导出 JSON 备份或 Markdown，以及从 JSON 备份替换数据。文件写入您选择的位置。您自行控制分享或存放在其他位置的副本。完整恢复会替换所有同步设备上的数据集，不是仅本机合并。备份包含提醒声音偏好，但不包含设备布局和引导状态。\n\n回收站和可恢复的冲突副本保留 30 天，并在 App 下次处理存储时清理。为防止旧离线编辑重新出现，私人 iCloud 中可能持续保留不含内容的删除元数据。超过 30 天删除优先期限后，很久未联网的设备若持有确实更新的编辑，可能恢复记录。待处理的云端更改需要启用同步且 iCloud 可用；关闭同步会保留本地副本，不会删除云端副本。\n\n“删除全部数据”要求输入本地化产品名称，并将数据替换为一个空收集箱。删除会在联网后传播到所有同步设备。本地清理或小组件刷新失败时可以重试。云端删除为异步过程：请检查同步状态并让其他设备重新联网。花瓣清单不会删除外部备份、导出文件、Apple 管理的备份或您分享的副本。仅能从自行保留的副本恢复。\n\n反馈会打开您的邮件 App，仅自动填写 App 版本、构建号、macOS 版本和架构。不会自动附带卡片内容、标识符、路径、日志或诊断信息。您自行决定是否发送及包含哪些内容。发送后，邮件服务商和已配置的支持邮箱将收到邮件。开发版本尚未配置支持邮箱，将在发布前配置。\n\n此静态帮助网站不使用 Cookie、分析、脚本、远程字体或外部资源。GitHub Pages 托管服务可能按 GitHub 自身隐私条款处理常规连接信息；花瓣清单不添加追踪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To add a widget, first launch Petal. Control-click your Mac desktop, choose Edit Widgets, find Petal, and add a medium or large widget. Petal cannot add a widget automatically. Edit the widget to select a card, one of five themes, a system typeface, and solid or translucent appearance.\n\nClick a todo circle in the widget to complete it. Click card text to open the editor, or the plus button to add to that card. Option–Command–N opens Quick Capture for Inbox; change or disable this shortcut in Settings. Return saves, Shift–Return adds a line, and Escape cancels. Failed saves keep your input for retry.\n\nCompleted todos remain visible that day, then disappear from the widget while remaining in the app. Daily todos become incomplete on a new local day. Completing a daily todo before its reminder may still allow today's notification; future daily reminders continue. Sound is off by default.\n\nCards remain available offline. Settings shows iCloud sync state and a retry action. Turning sync off keeps the local copy. An archived or trashed card cannot be edited through its widget; restore it in Petal or edit the widget to choose another card. Trash and conflict copies are kept for 30 days.\n\nThe editor separates completed todos from incomplete rows while preserving manual order. Undo returns a todo to its previous position. Daily streaks count consecutive local days; undo removes today's credit, and a missed day starts the next streak at one. Use a row's menu or the Delete command to remove that row.\n\nDismissed conflict notices do not remove their copies. Settings keeps unexpired copies available for reading, copying, and recovery. Recovery creates an ordinary card and is safe to repeat. Unrecovered conflict copies stay on this Mac for 30 days and are excluded from JSON backups; recover a copy first to include it in exports.\n\nSettings offers Windows import, JSON backup and full restore, and Markdown export. Import saves a backup first and ignores Windows window layout. Full restore replaces all synced devices. Delete All Data requires typing the product name and leaves one empty Inbox; export a backup first. If cleanup fails, retry in Settings. Cloud changes finish when iCloud is available and sync is enabled.\n\nHelp and Privacy are available offline in Settings. Feedback opens your mail app with only app version, build, macOS version, and architecture. Review the message before sending. A support mailbox will be configured before release; feedback is disabled until then."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加小组件前，请先启动花瓣清单。按住 Control 点按 Mac 桌面，选择“编辑小组件”，找到花瓣清单并添加中号或大号小组件。花瓣清单无法自动添加小组件。编辑小组件可选择卡片、五种主题之一、系统字体以及实色或半透明外观。\n\n点按小组件中的待办圆圈即可完成。点按卡片文字打开编辑器，点按加号向该卡片添加内容。Option–Command–N 打开收集箱的快速新增；可在设置中修改或关闭快捷键。Return 保存，Shift–Return 换行，Escape 取消。保存失败时会保留输入以便重试。\n\n已完成待办在当天继续显示，次日从小组件隐藏，但仍保留在 App 中。每日待办在新的本地日期恢复为未完成。在提醒时间前完成每日待办，当天仍可能收到通知；以后的每日提醒会继续。声音默认关闭。\n\n卡片可离线使用。设置中显示 iCloud 同步状态和重试操作。关闭同步保留本地副本。已归档或回收站中的卡片无法通过小组件编辑；可在花瓣清单中恢复，或编辑小组件选择其他卡片。回收站和冲突副本保留 30 天。\n\n编辑器将已完成待办与未完成内容分区显示，并保留手动顺序。撤销完成后，待办回到原来的相对位置。每日连续次数按当地日期计算；撤销移除今天的次数，漏过一天后下次从一开始。使用内容行菜单或 Delete 命令可删除单行。\n\n关闭冲突提示不会删除副本。设置中仍可查看、复制和恢复尚未到期的副本。恢复会创建普通卡片，重复操作不会创建重复卡片。未恢复的冲突副本仅在本机保留 30 天，不包含在 JSON 备份中；请先恢复为普通卡片再导出。\n\n设置提供 Windows 导入、JSON 备份和完整恢复以及 Markdown 导出。导入前会保存备份，Windows 窗口布局会被忽略。完整恢复会替换所有同步设备的数据。删除全部数据需要输入产品名称，并留下一个空收集箱；请先导出备份。清理失败时可在设置中重试。iCloud 可用且同步启用后，云端更改才会完成。\n\n设置中的帮助与隐私页面可离线查看。反馈会打开邮件 App，仅自动填写 App 版本、构建号、macOS 版本和架构。请在发送前检查邮件。支持邮箱将在发布前配置；配置前反馈不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
